    "summary": "Coffin (with lid); carved from wood; in the form of eagle; body painted gold with black, pink, gold and white feather markings; beak slightly open, painted orange with black tip, pink inside; eyes white and pink, pupil black; wings two separate pieces of wood joined with metal hinges, attached to back with metal hinges, coil of wire fastened to each wing to allow them to flap slightly; back opens to reveal cavity, sides lined with yellow silk, bottom with red textile, underside of lid lined with red textile; eagle stands on green platform with carrying handles painted black in each corner.",
